<title>USA: U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10.480 million bushels of U.S. soybeans inspected for export in the week ended Oct 10 were for the following destinations (1,000 bushels):</p>
<p>Toledo to Canada 1,967.</p>
<p>Mississippi River to Colombia 121; Germany 841; Italy 1,653; Japan 2,989; Netherlands 113; Trinidad 396; Venezuela 367.</p>
<p>Interior to Mexico 2,033.</p>
</text>
